        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a brief atmospheric adventure that was originally developed as a university project for mental health awareness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal, oppressive version of home where you must complete a handful of steps like chores or self care in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone.  If the other &quot;occupants&quot; of the house catch you, you’ll find yourself back where you started, in your bedroom, forced to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a short, narrative-driven experience intended to evoke empathy and understanding for the struggle of depression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate a surreal, dreamlike version of your home, rendered in evocative detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Gameplay:</strong> Complete everyday tasks to collect numbers, each step representing progress toward escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Impactful Experience:</strong> Designed to be finished in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game deals with themes of mental health and may be emotionally intense for some players.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a brief atmospheric adventure that was originally developed as a university project for mental health awareness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal, oppressive version of home where you must complete a handful of steps like chores or self care in order to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone.  If the other &quot;occupants&quot; of the house catch you, you’ll find yourself back where you started, in your bedroom, forced to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholia Maze is a short, narrative-driven experience intended to evoke empathy and understanding for the struggle of depression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Navigate a surreal, dreamlike version of your home, rendered in evocative detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic Gameplay:</strong> Complete everyday tasks to collect numbers, each step representing progress toward escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, Impactful Experience:</strong> Designed to be finished in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong> This game deals with themes of mental health and may be emotionally intense for some players.</p>",
